    <string name="measure_help_point_body">Touch the point with the probe, or move to it and tap the armed slot. The panel shows the position of the point. You can add the position as a sub-datum.</string>
    <string name="measure_help_distance_body">Locate two points. The panel shows the distance, the distance on each axis, and the midpoint. The tip radius is not compensated.</string>
    <string name="measure_help_circle3_body">Locate three points on a bore or a boss, well apart. The panel shows the center and the diameter. With a probe, the app compensates the tip radius from the approach directions.</string>
    <string name="measure_help_line_angle_body">Locate two points on a straight edge. The panel shows the angle of the edge to the X axis and to the Y axis.</string>
    <string name="measure_help_angle_lines_body">Locate two points on the first edge, then two points on the second edge. The panel shows the angle between the edges, its supplement, and the corner.</string>
